p=R/'docs/designs/m3-managed-h2-group-opening-boundary.md';s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('Status: DESIGN READINESS SPEC2 PASS; tests-first implementation started.','Status: DESIGN READINESS SPEC2 PASS; implementation and initial complete GREEN are ready for independent full implementation SPEC then CODE.');s+='\n## Root implementation checkpoint — initial complete GREEN\n\nTests-first23+23 missing-interface REDs are retained. Boundary implementation1 required Solrepair1 for strict compile unreachable-branch inference (fixed public apply to the unchanged literal activation), then Solrepair2 for optional group classification fields in minimal legacy H1/H3 callback states. The first compatibility run executed603/4 failures; all four KeyErrors and the original strict compile failure remain immutable. The production-only two-predicate compatibility repair preserves exact non-group identity; all41 original existing test files remain byte-identical. Initial postrepair2 format and forced strict compile passed; complete seven-file pure153/0 and complete36-file compatibility603/0 passed, each stable source, exit0, zero skips/exclusions. This is not full implementation review/fresh-gate acceptance. Counters: boundary implementation1/repairSol2/strictCompileFailure1/compatibilityFailure1/pure unsuccessfulGREEN0; intendedRED46 separate, all inherited counters retained, Astra2/2 exhausted.\n';p.write_text(s)
p=R/'docs/plans/m3-managed-h2-group-opening-boundary.md';s=p.read_text();before,after=s.split('## Task5:',1);before=before.replace('- [ ]','- [x]');s=before+'## Task5:'+after;s=s.replace('Independent SPEC2 reviewer verifies four corrections and exact enum/context/timing/result contracts.','After complete initial GREEN, an independent FULL IMPLEMENTATION SPEC reviewer verifies all adopted requirements, the four corrections and exact enum/context/timing/result contracts; design-readiness SPEC2 alone does not satisfy this gate.');s+='\n## Root initial verification checkpoint\n\nImplementation tasks1–4 are integrated behind the unchanged literal denial; checklist checks describe implemented behavior pending complete independent SPEC/CODE. RepairSol1 fixed the strict compiler inference through a constant public apply; repairSol2 fixed optional-field classification for legacy minimal H1/H3 states. Both failures and all original assertions are retained. Initial postrepair2 format/forced strict compile, seven-file pure153/0 and complete36-file compatibility603/0 pass with zero skips/exclusions and stable source. All41 existing test files are unchanged. Full implementation SPEC then CODE and fresh gates/local commit remain required. Boundary counters: implementation1/repairSol2/strictCompileFailure1/compatibilityFailure1/pure unsuccessfulGREEN0; intendedRED46 separate; inherited counters and Astra2/2 exhausted unchanged.\n';p.write_text(s)
p=R/'docs/acceptance/m3-managed-h2-group-opening-boundary.md';s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('Status: DESIGN READINESS PASS; tests-first implementation in progress.','Status: INITIAL COMPLETE GREEN; independent full implementation SPEC then CODE, fresh gates and local commit remain pending.');s=s.replace('Expected RED is recorded; implementation GREEN and acceptance gates remain unexecuted.','Expected RED and both implementation repair failures are retained. Initial complete GREEN is recorded; full review and fresh acceptance gates remain required.');s=s.replace('| Complete implementation and compatibility GREEN | NOT RUN |','| Complete initial format / forced strict compile | PASS, postrepair2 stable source / exit0 |\n| Complete implementation and compatibility GREEN | PASS, pure153/0 and36-file compatibility603/0; zero skips/exclusions |');s=s.replace('Counters: boundary design-readiness failedSPEC1; implementation0/repairSol0;','Counters: boundary design-readiness failedSPEC1; implementation1/repairSol2/strictCompileFailure1/compatibilityFailure1/pure unsuccessfulGREEN0; intendedRED46 separate;');s+='\nInitial failure retained: strict compile exit1 on literal-return inferred unreachable :ok branch; constant public apply preserves the same unconditional denial. First compatibility run603/4 failed with four KeyErrors from optional group classifier fields in existing minimal H1/H3 expiry/cancel states. Repair2 changes only the two classification predicates; all41 existing test files remain byte-identical. Complete initial postrepair2 command receipts and unchanged-test hashes are authenticated by `initial-green-summary1.json` in the evidence directory. These pure/staged results do not establish live group activation, memory/accounting bounds, network/browser, peer lifecycle or recovery ordering.\n';p.write_text(s)
p=R/'implement-plan.md';s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('Implementation is in progress behind literal accounting-not-ready denial; no GREEN or implementation acceptance is claimed.','Initial implementation GREEN now passes format/forced strict compile, pure153/0 and complete36-file compatibility603/0, with zero skips/exclusions and stable source. Solrepair1 fixed compiler inference via constant public apply to the unchanged denial; Solrepair2 fixed optional group fields in legacy minimal H1/H3 states. Both original failures remain retained and all41 existing test files are unchanged. Complete independent implementation SPEC then CODE, fresh gates and local commit remain pending; group activation/accounting is not accepted.');p.write_text(s)
